OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 27 FEB
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: Full Moon on Progress
OL,5,     FStreet - series 2
OL,6,     GDr Rommi Smith examines the music
OL,7,     Gand contributions of five leading
OL,8,     GBlack female musicians, to civil
OL,9,     Grights and social change.
OL,10,G2200FLate Junction
OL,11,     GVerity Sharp presents an
OL,12,     Gimprovised collaborative studio
OL,13,     Gmeeting between British
OL,14,     Gexperimentalist Ecka Mordecai and
OL,15,     GBhutanese guitarist Tashi Dorji.
OL,16,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,17,     GSoweto is joined by the ever-
OL,18,     Gexplorative jazz bassist Dave
OL,19,     GHolland to reflect on his career
OL,20,     Gand collaborations with jazz
OL,21,     Ggreats like Miles Davis, Chick
OL,22,     GCorea and Herbie Hancock.
